  "description": "Holywell Wood, Swords, Co. Dublin\n\n3 Bedroom | 3 Bathroom | End-Terrace House\n\nKennedy Property Services is delighted to present Holywell Wood, Swords to the rental market.\n\nThis spacious three-bedroom, three-bathroom end-terrace home offers excellent accommodation and is ideally for tenants looking for a well-located home in Swords.\n\nThe property benefits from a large and bright kitchen, providing generous space for dining and everyday family living. The main accommodation is complemented by three bathrooms, offering convenience and flexibility for residents.\n\nA particular feature of the property is the converted attic, which provides an additional versatile room that could be used as a home office, study, playroom or additional living space, subject to the intended use.\n\nAs an end-terrace property, the house also benefits from additional privacy and natural light compared with a mid-terrace home.\n\nProperty Features\nSpacious 3-bedroom end-terrace house\n3 bathrooms\nLarge kitchen with excellent storage and living space\nConverted attic providing an additional room\nBright and spacious accommodation\nExcellent location in Swords\nConvenient access to local schools, shops and amenities\nGood transport links to Dublin City and Dublin Airport\n\nHolywell Wood offers spacious and flexible accommodation in a popular residential location in Swords. Early viewing is highly recommended.",
